 and invest from your own wallet.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-08\"},{\"path\":\"/tools/wallet-checker\",\"title\":\"Wallet checker: holdings, DeFi, and cost basis\",\"description\":\"Paste an EVM or Solana address to see holdings on every chain, DeFi positions, and which holdings arrived without a purchase price. No signup. Read-only.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-08\"},{\"path\":\"/traders\",\"title\":\"Track on-chain positions and cost basis\",\"description\":\"Wallets on 100 chains, Solana DeFi positions, and exchanges in one record, with per-wallet cost basis where history exists.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-08\"},{\"path\":\"/businesses\",\"title\":\"Business finances across banks and wallets\",\"description\":\"In development: business accounts, cards, and payments on one ledger, with a shared view of bank accounts and wallets. Starting in the US and Canada.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-05\"},{\"path\":\"/funds\",\"title\":\"Fund positions, cash, and financial records\",\"description\":\"A planned workspace for funds and trading firms, connecting positions, cash, and activity across banks, exchanges, and wallets.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-05\"},{\"path\":\"/contact\",\"title\":\"Contact support\",\"description\":\"Contact BetterOff for help with your account, connections, billing, security, privacy, or a partnership. We usually reply within one business day.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-09-05\"},{\"path\":\"/about\",\"title\":\"About BetterOff\",\"description\":\"BetterOff is a financial platform for tracking, moving, investing, and trading money across traditional accounts and crypto. Built by Zachary Roth.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-08\"},{\"path\":\"/legal/terms\",\"title\":\"Terms of service\",\"description\":\"Review the BetterOff Terms of Service for account access, subscription billing, acceptable use, data handling, cancellation, refunds, and service limits.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-13\"},{\"path\":\"/legal/privacy\",\"title\":\"Privacy policy: data, AI, and your rights\",\"description\":\"Learn what BetterOff collects, how financial and AI data is handled, which providers receive data, and how to use access, export, and deletion rights.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-13\"},{\"path\":\"/legal/security\",\"title\":\"Security practices\",\"description\":\"How BetterOff protects your data: read-only imports, passkeys, encryption, access controls, monitoring, and incident response.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-13\"},{\"path\":\"/legal/disclosures\",\"title\":\"Disclosures\",\"description\":\"Review important limits for BetterOff financial data, calculations, third-party connections, AI answers, and informational content before relying on a result.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-13\"},{\"path\":\"/legal/credits\",\"title\":\"Credits\",\"description\":\"Open-source software and other work that BetterOff uses, with the notices their licenses require.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-08\"},{\"path\":\"/calculators\",\"title\":\"Financial calculators\",\"description\":\"Model mortgages, investing, debt payoff, emergency funds, retirement, inflation, and digital assets with calculators whose assumptions you can inspect.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-09-05\"},{\"path\":\"/pricing\",\"title\":\"Pricing: free plan and Core at $20/month\",\"description\":\"BetterOff is free for wallets, DeFi, and exchanges. No card required. Core is $20/month plus tax for banks, the Assistant, and 2 people.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-08\"},{\"path\":\"/coverage\",\"title\":\"Supported banks, exchanges, and chains\",\"description\":\"See which banks, brokerages, exchanges, chains, and DeFi protocols BetterOff connects, and what each connection reads into your net worth.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-06\"},{\"path\":\"/agents\",\"title\":\"Connect BetterOff to Codex and Claude Code\",\"description\":\"Connect your BetterOff household to an MCP client such as Codex or Claude Code. Ask about your finances and prepare corrections for your approval.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-06\"},{\"path\":\"/developers\",\"title\":\"BetterOff API beta for developers\",\"description\":\"Read BetterOff data with API tokens and receive signed webhooks. Covers token scopes, webhook events, signature checks, and the beta stability policy.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-12\"},{\"path\":\"/coverage/exchanges\",\"title\":\"Supported crypto exchanges\",\"description\":\"See which digital asset exchanges BetterOff connects. Review read-only API key requirements and the account data each connection can read.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-07\"},{\"path\":\"/coverage/institutions\",\"title\":\"Search supported U.S. banks and brokerages\",\"description\":\"Search Plaid's U.S. institution catalog and review listed Transactions, Investments, Liabilities, and Balance products before connecting to BetterOff.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-09-18\"},{\"path\":\"/financial-checklist\",\"title\":\"Free household financial checklist\",\"description\":\"Answer eight household finance questions and get a free 0–100 score without signing up. Then review the full 27-item checklist.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-09-27\"},{\"path\":\"/faq\",\"title\":\"FAQ: pricing, security, accounts, and AI\",\"description\":\"Answers about the BetterOff free plan, pricing, security, supported accounts, the BetterOff Assistant, shared access, refunds, and cancellation.\",\"indexable\":true,\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-08\"},{\"path\":\"/learn\",\"title\":\"Guides to money, crypto, and taxes\",\"description\":\"Guides to US crypto taxes and household money, written from primary sources and dated, plus a glossar