tors/high-yield-savings\",\"title\":\"High-yield savings calculator\",\"description\":\"Calculate the extra interest idle cash could earn at a higher APY, before and after tax, while keeping the cash you need for bills.\",\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-07\",\"indexable\":true},{\"path\":\"/calculators/bank-bonus\",\"title\":\"Bank bonus calculator\",\"description\":\"Calculate what a bank account sign-up bonus is worth after income tax, monthly fees, and the interest your required deposit gives up.\",\"lastModified\":\"2026-10-07\",\"indexable\":true},{\"path\":\"/calculators/compound-interest\",\"title\":\"Compound interest calculator: monthly \u0026 daily\",\"description\":\"Compare monthly, daily, weekly, or annual compounding with monthly contributions. See your projected balance, deposits, and interest in a yearly breakdown.\",\"lastModified\":\"2026-09-05\",\"indexable\":true},{\"path\":\"/calculators/dca\",\"title\":\"DCA vs. lump-sum calculator\",\"description\":\"Compare dollar-cost averaging with investing a lump sum. Test the same cash across hypothetical market paths, purchase schedules, and ending values.\",\"lastModified\":\"2026-09-10\",\"indexable\":true},{\"path\":\"/calculators/investment-return\",\"title\":\"Investment return calculator\",\"description\":\"Calculate total investment return, annualized CAGR, dollar gain, and dividend impact from beginning value, ending value, and holding period.\",\"lastModified\":\"2026-09-10\",\"indexable\":true},{\"path\":\"/calculators/portfolio-allocation\",\"title\":\"Portfolio allocation calculator\",\"description\":\"Explore an illustrative mix of U.S. stocks, international stocks, bonds, and cash. Adjust time horizon and risk tolerance, then review the assumptions.\",\"lastModified\":\"2026-09-05\",\"indexable\":true},{\"path\":\"/calculators/mortgage\",\"title\":\"PITI mortgage calculator with PMI\",\"description\":\"Estimate a monthly mortgage payment with principal, interest, taxes, insurance, HOA fees, and